The Gather node deserves a closer look since it's the least obvious part of the export. Rather than leaving "read column 1 of the probability tensor" as something the MQL5 caller has to know and get right, the node bakes that slicing directly into the saved graph — the .onnx file itself outputs a single float named
prob_up
