onnx.checker.check_model()
call right before saving exists specifically to catch a graph left in an inconsistent state by this kind of manual surgery — if the output shape declaration and what the Gather node actually produces ever drifted apart, this is where it would be caught, at export time on a developer's machine, rather than as a silent runtime failure inside
OnnxRun()
on a live chart.
